{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Before</b> — He mentioned Ephraim first, after the manner of Jacob, and because he was the standard-bearer." "<b>לכה</b> — Like לך, say the masters of tradition, for it is plene, the sense being ולכה — 'and upon you is the matter to save us.' But this interpretation is not right in my eyes."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 80, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:29.791975639Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}